GNS3 is a graphical network simulator focused on Cisco and Juniper
emulations. The gns3-server component runs the API and orchestrates the
emulators (Dynamips, QEMU, VPCS) and the uBridge network helper.

This port installs the server side only. The desktop GUI is provided by
net/gns3-gui (optional); the built-in Web UI is served by the server itself
at http://127.0.0.1:3080.
